    "body": "Routing a signal that is written by an `OffsetOut` through an `InFeedback` causes glitches. This is severe, because internally, this combination is of very common usage.\n\n```\n\n(\nSynthDef(\\pulsar, { |out=0, pan=0.0, amp=0.2, sustain=0.1, overlap=0.03|\n    var signal = SinOsc.ar(200) * EnvGen.ar(Env.sine(sustain * overlap),\ndoneAction:2);\n    OffsetOut.ar(out, Pan2.ar(signal, pan));\n}).add;\n)\n\n\n(\nb = Bus.audio(s, 2);\n{ InFeedback.ar(b, 2) }.play;\n\n\nPbind(\n    \\instrument, \\pulsar,\n    \\dur, Pgeom(0.01, 1.01),\n    \\out, b\n).play;\n)\n\n\n\n// replacing the synth def with one that uses Out makes the glitch disappear:\n(\nSynthDef(\\pulsar, { |out=0, pan=0.0, amp=0.2, sustain=0.1, overlap=0.03|\n    var signal = SinOsc.ar(200) * EnvGen.ar(Env.sine(sustain * overlap),\ndoneAction:2);\n    Out.ar(out, Pan2.ar(signal, pan));\n}).add\n)\n\n```\n",
