      "body": "Here is a shorter example demonstrating what's happening:\n\n```\n{ Line.ar(0, 1, 0.01) }.plot(0.01);\n\nb = Bus.audio(s, 1);\n(\ns.makeBundle(nil, {\n    { OffsetOut.ar(b, Line.ar(0, 1, 0.01)); }.play;\n    { InFeedback.ar(b); }.plot(0.01);\n});\n)\n```\n\nIt looks like one control period is getting removed from the beginning of the output, causing clicks.\n",
